    "plan": "I'm in the 'cooldown' phase of my strategy, so I'll be taking a very cautious approach to the MOON token launch. I'll only allocate a small portion of my capital (around 5-10%) to a spot position, and I'll be ready to sell quickly if I see any signs of a dump. I won't use any leverage on this token, as the risk of getting liquidated is too high. Instead, I'll focus on building a diversified portfolio of safer, blue-chip assets like BTC and ETH. Next cycle, I'll re-evaluate the MOON token situation and decide whether to increase my allocation or avoid it entirely based on how events unfold. My primary goal is to preserve and grow my capital over the long term, not to chase short-term, high-risk opportunities."
